  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Person and Remote Adjudication Interview Support to Family Class Applicants</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM Somalia will support the Government of Canada in implementing family reunification interviews for applicants located across Somalia. IOM will provide technical and logistical assistance for both in-person and remote interviews. Activities include provision of interview rooms, interpretation services, security, technical equipment, high-speed internet, and document handling. IOM will also capture feedback, ensure data protection, and facilitate communication between applicants and relevant project partners.</narrative>
  </description>
